 the film  and decide the further plot of part 8.  another stunt may not be as plot  relevant as the train shot but it is all  the more impressive we're talking about  tom cruise's motorcycle stunt which made  headlines long before the trailer was  released we see how the soon 60 year old  crew speeds over the precipice and saves  himself with a parachute at the very  last second actually not much of a  surprise anymore with the franchise of  course there was no stunned duel in  action here either just tom cruise  himself allegedly he performed over 13  000 motocross jumps and over 500  parachute jumps in preparation as we are  told the actor had only one attempt to  make the scene work a small mistake on  the motorcycle or parachute could have  had disastrous consequences thus it is  all the more remarkable that he wanted  to perform the stun himself what some  may have missed he is wearing the same  outfit there as in the scene with a  train  will he actually land on the train in  style with his parachute we can't wait  to find out  after we have already mentioned some of  the names and characters we will now  list the actors who are involved in  mission impossible dead reckoning part  1. of course the familiar team of heroes  once again consists of tom cruise as  ethan hunt rebecca ferguson as ilsa  faust simon pagas benji dunn and wing  rhames as luther's stickle we are also  happy to see the return of henry cherny  who will play the aforementioned eugene  kid rich one more time on the villain  side there's also an old familiar face  and that is vanessa kirby as white widow  new to the cast rsi morales as this  still nameless antagonist haley and  willis grace along with shea wiggum as  jasper bricks who will be following  ethan hunt in part seven and eight among  the actress with the still unknown roles  are palm clementiev carrie elvis indira  varma margates and rob delaney  lastly let's talk about the production  of the movie and some facts worth  mentioning 